<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>An update on your JACOB content</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: sans-serif; color: #1a1a1a; background: #f9f9f9; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    .container { max-width: 560px; margin: 32px auto; background: #fff; border-radius: 8px; padding: 32px; }
    .logo { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; color: #2563eb; margin-bottom: 24px; }
    p { line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 16px; }
    .footer { margin-top: 32px; font-size: 12px; color: #6b7280; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="logo">JACOB</div>
    <p>Hi {{ display_name }},</p>
    <p>
      A moderator has reviewed a {{ resource_type }} you posted in JACOB and determined
      that it doesn't meet our community guidelines.
    </p>
    {% if reason %}
    <p><strong>Reason:</strong> {{ reason }}</p>
    {% endif %}
    <p>
      The {{ resource_type }} has been removed. If you believe this was a mistake,
      please reply to this email or contact us at
      <a href="mailto:{{ appeal_email }}">{{ appeal_email }}</a>.
    </p>
    <p>
      We want JACOB to remain a safe and encouraging space for everyone.
      Thank you for understanding.
    </p>
    <p>— The JACOB team</p>
    <div class="footer">
      You received this email because you have an account on JACOB.
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
